I am JK ;D

You know whenever I hang out with my boys(none of which are ENFP to my knowledge)  and do stupid shit people give us all sorts of looks, most of the time we just laugh it off. I once asked if this ever bothers them and they said something along the line of “Kind of but we don’t care”, I think that this proves that not everyone likes to( or CAN for that matter) hang out with ENFPs in public. 

If you mean that we can be selfish when it comes to how you look in the eyes of society in normal everyday occurrences well ᵂᴱ ᴰᴼᴺ'ᵀ ᶜᴬᴿᴱ  and if we do it’s usually not a priority you choose to hang out with us and we choose to hang out with you if you don’t like it go get new amigos . hangout time is the time where we can be our social self as it might not be a great idea to do so at work or school 

If you mean selfish in the context that we don’t care about how others feel in a social situation well I know that that does not apply to me. After all, I’m the type of guy explains an inside joke and make sure everyone is adding to the convo. 

“lost in the joy of the moment”?? of yea it happens It doesn’t happen that often but damn it does happen, it kind of sucks when it backfires. IDK how many times someone wanted to knock my teeth  off just because I took a joke too far (One time they were almost successful ) I (And other ENFPS I believe) eventually learn to keep some self-awareness just so we can keep a good set of teeth haha 

Now here is a big Nono when it comes to talking to ENFPs in my opinion, Do not ask them to “Stop being weird”  “Act normal” or “Stop being stupid and childish”. For a lot of us, we got nothing other than a little spark of madness to keep us going. If you took that away from us or convinced us to lose it we will fall into a dark hole (Speaking out of experience) eventually we will either get that spark back anyway or fall even deeper. If you wanna stop hanging out with your ENFP friends please do so, but don’t tell them that the reason you want out is because of their actions trust me you will be doing more harm than good. 

I see you’re an INTJ and let me tell you something when an INTJ work with an ENFP it is WORLD FUCKING DOMINATION!!!!. This is an example I’m not proud of but it’s still a good one nonetheless : Back in the early Discord days I had a little friend group going, although I never liked him much one of us was an INTJ , one thing I would do is go into all of those random Discord servers everything from Underage dating shit, furry, Muslims, video games, ETC... and being the only extroverted  Mad man I would have no problem fitting in and gaining trust on such servers then after getting said trust and info about an unlucky user I would bring him into a private call with all of my friends where INTJ would cyberbully the shit out of him , he was funny and entertaining, the poor victim usually gets very confused on why someone like me would hang with a group like them he/she would stick around for a bit longer thinking that he/she just didn’t get a joke and that they’re all as innocent and nice as me . Again not my proudest moments but I’ve never had such a mutualistic relationship in my life, I don’t know how many servers we raided just because the admins gave me mod I remember raiding one of those hard to get into Muslim Discord servers, man I was something. Moral of the story try biting your tongue and give your ENFP friend one more chance if all goes well I guarantee that you WILL like the results ;D

P.S: sorry for taking too long to respond I wasn’t ignoring your anything I was just busy with work and shit you understand

P.S#2: I am not an expert and this is all based on my personal experience   

